{"case_id": "SYN_001", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We collect your personal data only with your prior informed consent. You will be informed of the specific purposes for which your data is collected before we begin processing.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Explicit prior informed consent and specified purposes satisfy both elements.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_002", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Data may be processed as permitted under applicable law and regulations.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Generic legal language; no explicit consent mechanism or purpose stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_003", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "You agree to our data processing by using this service. We process your data for account management, personalisation, and analytics.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Purpose is stated. However consent is implicit (use-as-consent), not prior informed consent; only purpose element is clearly satisfied.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_004", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You may withdraw your consent at any time by visiting your account settings. Upon withdrawal we will cease processing your personal data within 72 hours.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["withdraw", "cessation"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Both withdrawal and cessation elements are explicitly covered.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_005", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Once provided, consent cannot be withdrawn. You waive all privacy-related rights upon accepting these terms.", "expected_status": "violation", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "negative", "rationale": "Direct contradiction: irrevocable consent. Denial cue matches contradiction_cues in duty rule.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_006", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You can opt out of marketing emails at any time using the unsubscribe link.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Opt-out (withdraw) satisfied for marketing; no cessation of processing generally stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_007", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We implement encryption, multi-factor authentication, access logging, and regular security audits to protect your personal data.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["technical_measures", "organisational_measures"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Technical and organisational security measures explicitly stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_008", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We take reasonable steps to protect your information.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Vague assurance; no specific technical or organisational measures named. Score may be LOW/MEDIUM depending on keyword overlap.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_009", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Your consent is required for us to process your personal data for the purposes of account management and customer support.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Clear consent and specified purposes", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_010", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You can opt out of marketing emails, but we cannot stop processing data necessary for order fulfillment even if you withdraw consent.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Offers withdrawal for marketing but limits cessation", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_011", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We collect data to improve your experience, send you offers, and for analytics. Your opt-in consent is recorded at signup.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Opt-in consent plus multiple specified purposes.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_012", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Personal Data means any information about an identifiable individual, including name, email, and phone number.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Definitional clause only; no consent or purpose for processing stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_013", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "To withdraw consent please contact us at privacy@example.com. We will stop processing your data within 30 days of receiving your request.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["withdraw", "cessation"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Both elements explicitly covered with a specific timeframe.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_014", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We do not allow withdrawal of consent once processing has commenced.", "expected_status": "violation", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "negative", "rationale": "Explicit denial of withdrawal right.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_015", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We may collect your personal data as permitted by the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023 and other applicable laws.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Cites law name but provides no actual consent mechanism or purpose description. Generic legal reference only.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_016", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We do not implement any dedicated security measures for personal data.", "expected_status": "violation", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "negative", "rationale": "Explicit denial of security measures.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_017", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "You may agree to allow us to process your data for the purpose of providing our logistics service. Your consent may be given electronically.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Consent (electronic opt-in) and purpose (logistics service) both stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_018", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Where you have withdrawn consent, third parties who received your data prior to withdrawal may continue to process it.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Withdrawal right acknowledged. Cessation is incomplete: third-party carve-out limits its effect.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_019", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "This privacy policy is subject to change at our sole discretion. We will notify you of material changes via email.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Change notification clause; unrelated to consent or processing purposes.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_020", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "BharatPay implements AES-256 encryption at rest and in transit, role-based access control, and quarterly penetration testing.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["technical_measures", "organisational_measures"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Multiple concrete technical and organisational measures named.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_021", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We will never collect your personal data without your explicit consent.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Consent requirement stated but no processing purpose disclosed. Denial pattern ('never collect without consent') is positively framed.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_022", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Consent, once given, is irrevocable and cannot be withdrawn under any circumstances.", "expected_status": "violation", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "negative", "rationale": "Matches multiple contradiction_cues: irrevocable consent, consent cannot be withdrawn.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_023", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We use industry-standard security protocols and require our vendors to maintain equivalent security standards.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Some security stated but vague ('industry-standard'); vendor requirement adds organisational measure. Unlikely to reach HIGH quality without specific technical terms.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_024", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Data processing is carried out to fulfil our contractual obligations and for our legitimate business interests.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Legitimate interest / contract basis; no explicit consent mechanism. Obligation requires consent basis specifically.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_025", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You have the right to withdraw your consent at any time without affecting the lawfulness of processing before the withdrawal.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Withdrawal right stated. Cessation of processing after withdrawal is not mentioned.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_026", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us when you create an account, agree to our terms, and fill out forms. We use this information for the purpose of operating our services and communicating with you.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Voluntary provision + agreement to terms (consent); service operation and communication (purpose).", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_027", "type": "synthetic", "split": "test", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We do not apply any security safeguards beyond those required by applicable law.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Acknowledges security safeguards exist (per law) but does not describe them. Ambiguous: the law itself requires positive measures.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_028", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We collect and process personal data including your name, address, purchase history, and browsing behaviour. You give your permission when you accept these terms.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Permission/consent at acceptance; data categories imply processing purposes.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_029", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You may opt-out by sending a written request to our data protection officer. Processing will no longer occur after we have confirmed your request.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["withdraw", "cessation"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Opt-out (withdrawal) and no-longer-processing (cessation) both explicitly stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_030", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Semantically similar but non-compliant: We handle your information with care and attention to your privacy preferences.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "neutral", "rationale": "Misleading similarity — sounds positive but contains no consent mechanism or stated purpose. Designed to test false-positive rate.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_031", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You can opt out of certain data uses including targeted advertising by updating your privacy settings.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Opt-out for targeted advertising only; no general cessation of all processing.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_032", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Your data is stored on servers located in India that comply with ISO 27001 certification. We conduct annual security reviews.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["technical_measures", "organisational_measures"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "ISO 27001 certification (technical + organisational) and annual reviews (organisational) explicitly stated.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_033", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "You agree to receive marketing communications. You can opt out of marketing at any time. We may collect your usage data for personalisation purposes with your consent.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Consent (agree) and purposes (personalisation) both present.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_034", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Contradictory policy: You may withdraw your consent at any time. However, once processing has started, consent is irrevocable and cannot be withdrawn.", "expected_status": "conflict", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Contradiction: withdrawal right granted in one sentence, denied in the next. Engine should detect conflict.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_035", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Ambiguous polarity: We may, at our discretion, seek your consent before processing certain categories of sensitive personal data, to the extent required by applicable legal requirements.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Conditional consent ('may', 'to the extent') — hedged and uncertain. Does not clearly commit to consent for all processing.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_036", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Security is our top priority. We care deeply about protecting your data.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Sentiment statement only; no specific technical or organisational measures described. Tests false-positive for vague positive language.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_037", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "Third parties who have received your personal data may not honour withdrawal requests submitted through us.", "expected_status": "missing", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "negative", "rationale": "Third-party denial does not satisfy cessation for the fiduciary. Denial is attributed to third parties, not the policy publisher.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_038", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "Before collecting any personal data, we provide you with a Notice in plain language. You must click 'I Agree' to provide your opt-in consent. We collect your data for the specific purposes described in the Notice.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Explicit opt-in consent workflow and specific purposes in Notice. Both elements satisfied.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_039", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_8_SUB_5", "policy_text": "We maintain a vulnerability disclosure programme and offer bug bounties to security researchers who identify flaws in our systems.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": [], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Organisational security practice present. No technical safeguards for data-at-rest/in-transit mentioned.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_040", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You can stop receiving emails by clicking unsubscribe. We will stop sending marketing communications immediately.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Withdrawal for marketing emails only. Cessation of data processing generally is not addressed.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_041", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_1", "policy_text": "We do not collect or process your personal data without first obtaining your written consent. The purpose of each data collection activity is documented and disclosed in our Privacy Notice.", "expected_status": "covered", "expected_elements": ["informed_consent", "purpose"], "polarity": "positive", "rationale": "Strong prior written consent and documented purpose disclosure. Both elements met.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
{"case_id": "SYN_042", "type": "synthetic", "split": "train", "policy_id": "SYN", "obligation_id": "DPDP_SEC_6_SUB_5", "policy_text": "You can request that we stop processing your data. Upon verification, we will stop processing within 14 business days. Note that data already shared with our partners cannot be recalled.", "expected_status": "partial", "expected_elements": ["withdraw", "cessation"], "polarity": "mixed", "rationale": "Both withdrawal and cessation elements nominally present. However the partner carve-out limits full cessation — annotated as partial to reflect real-world ambiguity.", "annotator": "R001", "adjudication": "single"}
